ông cß║ú tß╗½ g├│c ─æß╗Ö l├╜ thuyß║┐t v├á thß╗▒c tß║┐</strong>. Ngo├ái viß╗çc ph├ón t├¡ch c├íc quy ─æß╗ïnh cß╗ºa c├íc v─ân bß║ún ph├íp luß║¡t, cuß╗æn s├ích c┼⌐ng ph├ón t├¡ch c├íc ├ín lß╗ç v├á bß║ún ├ín.</li>\n<li><strong>─É├óy l├á cuß╗æn s├ích gi├║p c├íc luß║¡t s╞░ h├ánh nghß╗ü c├│ thß╗â tham khß║úo khi t╞░ vß║Ñn trong c├íc giao dß╗ïch th╞░╞íng mß║íi c├│ yß║┐u tß╗æ n╞░ß╗¢c ngo├ái</strong>. Cuß╗æn s├ích tß║¡p trung ph├ón t├¡ch phß║ím vi m├á c├íc b├¬n c├│ thß╗â thß╗Åa thuß║¡n trong hß╗úp ─æß╗ông ─æß╗â ph├ón bß╗æ rß╗ºi ro.</li>\n<li><strong>─É├óy l├á cuß╗æn s├ích duy nhß║Ñt c├│ hß╗ç thß╗æng tra cß╗⌐u ─æß║ºy ─æß╗º gi├║p ng╞░ß╗¥i ─æß╗ìc tiß╗çn tra cß╗⌐u</strong>. Cuß╗æn s├ích c├│ (i) bß║úng tra cß╗⌐u tß╗½ kh├│a; (ii) bß║úng tra cß╗⌐u ├ín lß╗ç, bß║ún ├ín v├á quyß║┐t ─æß╗ïnh; v├á (iii) danh s├ích c├íc t├ái liß╗çu tr├¡ch dß║½n.<br /><br /><br /><strong>Mß╗¥i bß║ín ─æß╗ìc tham khß║úo nhß╗»ng cuß╗æn s├ích kh├íc ß╗ƒ link: <a href="https://tiki.vn/cua-hang/sach-luat-vn">https://tiki.vn/cua-hang/sach-luat-vn</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img id="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/49/d3/c0/90ee5e9455425eb79999a9c913d47fa1.jpg" title="" src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/49/d3/c0/90ee5e9455425eb79999a9c913d47fa1.jpg" alt="" width="undefined" height="undefined" /></p>\n<p><img id="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f9/03/6a/1686f12f7fed2b0a6f7b00da6aa0fd69.jpg" title="" src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f9/03/6a/1686f12f7fed2b0a6f7b00da6aa0fd69.jpg" alt="" width="undefined" height="undefined" /></p>\n<p><img id="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/4b/31/f9/39d39937a5d504d6397366a746925d7a.jpg" title="" src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/4b/31/f9/39d39937a5d504d6397366a746925d7a.jpg" alt="" width="undefined" height="undefined" /></p>\n<p><img id="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/d3/5f/6c/aae7dbea2abc8c134ba3f0588bac5b22.jpg" title="" src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/d3/5f/6c/aae7dbea2abc8c134ba3f0588bac5b22.jpg" alt="" width="undefined" height="undefined" /></p>\n<p><img id="https:/