n</li>\n<li data-start="1205" data-end="1344">\n<p data-start="1207" data-end="1344">C├ích x├óy dß╗▒ng <strong data-start="1221" data-end="1253">khß║ú n─âng phß║ún biß╗çn vß╗»ng v├áng</strong> ─æß╗â tß╗▒ tin ─æß╗æi thoß║íi, tranh luß║¡n v├á lß╗▒a chß╗ìn s├íng suß╗æt h╞ín trong c├┤ng viß╗çc lß║½n cuß╗Öc sß╗æng.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="1375" data-end="1403"><strong>Qua cuß╗æn s├ích n├áy, bß║ín sß║╜:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start="1405" data-end="1927">\n<li data-start="1405" data-end="1515">\n<p data-start="1407" data-end="1515"><strong data-start="1407" data-end="1442">Nhß║¡n diß╗çn v├á h├│a giß║úi ngß╗Ñy biß╗çn</strong>: tß╗½ thi├¬n kiß║┐n x├íc nhß║¡n, suy luß║¡n cß║úm t├¡nh cho ─æß║┐n ΓÇ£hiß╗çu ß╗⌐ng bß║ºy ─æ├ánΓÇ¥.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1516" data-end="1624">\n<p data-start="1518" data-end="1624"><strong data-start="1518" data-end="1546">X├óy dß╗▒ng luß║¡n ─æiß╗âm logic</strong>: biß║┐t c├ích triß╗ân khai tiß╗ün ─æß╗ü ΓÇô luß║¡n cß╗⌐ ΓÇô kß║┐t luß║¡n chß║╖t chß║╜ v├á thuyß║┐t phß╗Ñc.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1625" data-end="1709">\n<p data-start="1627" data-end="1709"><strong data-start="1627" data-end="1656">Ph├ít triß╗ân t╞░ duy ─æß╗Öc lß║¡p</strong>: kh├┤ng c├▓n lß╗ç thuß╗Öc v├áo ─æ├ím ─æ├┤ng hay truyß╗ün th├┤ng.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1710" data-end="1820">\n<p data-start="1712" data-end="1820"><strong data-start="1712" data-end="1743">Biß║┐t lß║»ng nghe v├á ph├ón t├¡ch</strong>: tranh luß║¡n tr├¬n tinh thß║ºn t├┤n trß╗ìng v├á l├╜ tr├¡, thay v├¼ c├┤ng k├¡ch c├í nh├ón.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1821" data-end="1927">\n<p data-start="1823" data-end="1927"><strong data-start="1823" data-end="1862">Biß║┐n phß║ún biß╗çn th├ánh th├│i quen sß╗æng</strong>: gi├║p bß║ín tr╞░ß╗ƒng th├ánh h╞ín trong mß╗ìi t├¼nh huß╗æng ra quyß║┐t ─æß╗ïnh.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="1823" data-end="1927"><strong>Vß╗ü t├íc giß║ú</strong></p>\n<p data-start="1954" data-end="2251"><strong data-start="1954" data-end="1975">Albert Rutherford</strong> l├á t├íc giß║ú chuy├¬n viß║┐t s├ích vß╗ü <strong data-start="2007" data-end="2069">t╞░ duy logic, khoa hß╗ìc nhß║¡n thß╗⌐c v├á kß╗╣ n─âng t╞░ duy bß║¡c cao</strong>. C├íc t├íc phß║⌐m cß╗ºa ├┤ng th╞░ß╗¥ng ─æ╞░ß╗úc ─æ├│n nhß║¡n bß╗ƒi ─æß╗Öc giß║ú mong muß╗æn cß║úi thiß╗çn khß║ú n─âng suy ngh─⌐ ─æß╗Öc lß║¡p, tr├ính bß╗ï thao t├║ng v├á ph├ít triß╗ân tr├¡ tuß╗ç phß║ún biß╗çn trong kß╗╖ nguy├¬n th├┤ng tin.</p>\n<p data-start="1954" data-end="2251"><strong>Cuß╗æn s├ích n├áy cho:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start="2291" data-end="2641">\n<li data-start="2291" data-end="2364">\n<p data-start="2293" data-end="2364">Nhß╗»ng ai <strong data-start="2302" data-end="2361">muß╗æn tho├ít khß╗Åi sß╗▒ chi phß╗æi cß╗ºa d╞░ luß║¡n v├á truyß╗ün th├┤ng</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2365" data-end="2448">\n<p data-start="2367" data-end="2448">Ng╞░ß╗¥i trß║╗ ─æang t├¼m kiß║┐m <strong data-start="2391" data-end="2409">t╞░ duy ─æß╗Öc lß║¡p</strong> ─æß╗â hß╗ìc tß║¡p, l├ám viß╗çc v├á khß╗ƒi nghiß╗çp.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2449" data-end="2557">\n<p data-start="2451" data-end="2557">Doanh nh├ón, quß║ún l├╜, ng╞░ß╗¥i l├ám viß╗çc trong m├┤i tr╞░ß╗¥ng cß║ính tranh cß║ºn <strong data-start="2519" data-end="2554">ra quyß║┐t ─æß╗ïnh tß╗ënh t├ío v├á logic</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>─Éß╗½ng ─æß╗â ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├íc suy ngh─⌐ thay bß║ín. <em data-start="3095" data-end="3124">Nghß╗ç Thuß║¡t T╞░ Duy Phß║ún Biß╗çn</em> gi├║p bß║ín r├¿n luyß╗çn mß╗Öt bß╗Ö ├│c tß╗ënh t├ío, logic v├á ─æß╗Öc lß║¡p.</strong></p><p>Gi├í sß║ún phß║⌐m tr├¬n Tiki ─æ├ú bao gß╗ôm thuß║┐ theo luß║¡t hiß╗çn h├ánh. B├¬n cß║ính ─æ├│, tuß╗│ v├áo loß║íi sß║ún phß║⌐m, h├¼nh thß╗⌐c v├á ─æß╗ïa chß╗ë giao h├áng m├á c├│ thß╗â ph├ít sinh th├¬m chi ph├¡ kh├íc nh╞░ ph├¡ vß║¡n chuyß╗ân, phß╗Ñ ph├¡ h├áng cß╗ông kß╗ünh, thuß║┐ nhß║¡p khß║⌐u (─æß╗æi vß╗¢i ─æ╞ín h├áng giao tß╗½ n╞░ß╗¢c ngo├ái c├│ gi├í trß╗ï tr├¬n 1 triß╗çu ─æß╗ông).....</p>	Thß║úo Trß║ºn (2Γ¡É): Bß║ún dß╗ïch tß╗ç, diß╗àn ─æß║ít tß╗æi ngh─⌐a. S├ích kh├┤ng ─æc kiß╗âm duyß╗çt chau 