ata-end="1653">\n<li data-start="1158" data-end="1323">\n<p data-start="1160" data-end="1323">Mß╗Öt c├óu chuyß╗çn tiß║┐p nß╗æi gay cß║Ñn v├á ─æß║ºy cß║úm x├║c tß╗½ <em data-start="1210" data-end="1220">Beartown</em>, ─æ╞░a bß║ín trß╗ƒ lß║íi vß╗¢i nhß╗»ng nh├ón vß║¡t c┼⌐, nh╞░ng trong mß╗Öt trß║íng th├íi tß╗òn th╞░╞íng h╞ín, tr╞░ß╗ƒng th├ánh h╞ín.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1324" data-end="1432">\n<p data-start="1326" data-end="1432">Nhß╗»ng c├óu hß╗Åi s├óu sß║»c vß╗ü ─æß║ío ─æß╗⌐c, l├▓ng trung th├ánh, sß╗▒ tha thß╗⌐ v├á viß╗çc lß╗¢n l├¬n trong mß╗Öt x├ú hß╗Öi nhß╗Å hß║╣p.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1433" data-end="1534">\n<p data-start="1435" data-end="1534">V─ân phong sß║»c sß║úo, nhiß╗üu tß║ºng ngh─⌐a cß╗ºa Fredrik Backman sß║╜ khiß║┐n bß║ín nghß║╣n lß╗¥i kh├┤ng chß╗ë mß╗Öt lß║ºn.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1535" data-end="1653">\n<p data-start="1537" data-end="1653">Mß╗Öt cuß╗æn tiß╗âu thuyß║┐t thß╗â thao, nh╞░ng lß║íi chß╗⌐a ─æß╗▒ng cß║ú mß╗Öt x├ú hß╗Öi thu nhß╗Å vß╗¢i ─æß║ºy ─æß╗º tß╗òn th╞░╞íng, t├¼nh y├¬u v├á giß║Ñc m╞í.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>V├ái N├⌐t Vß╗ü T├íc Giß║ú &amp; Phong C├ích:┬á</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Fredrik Backman</strong>┬ál├á nh├á v─ân Thß╗Ñy ─Éiß╗ân nß╗òi tiß║┐ng vß╗¢i phong c├ích kß╗â chuyß╗çn vß╗½a d├¡ dß╗Åm, vß╗½a thß║Ñm th├¡a. C├íc t├íc phß║⌐m cß╗ºa ├┤ng nh╞░ "<a href="https://tiki.vn/nguoi-dan-ong-mang-ten-ove-tai-ban-2022-p202879294.html?spid=202879295">Ng╞░ß╗¥i ─æ├án ├┤ng mang t├¬n Ove"</a>┬áhay "<a href="https://tiki.vn/britt-marie-da-o-day-fredrid-backman-p243006533.html?spid=243006534">Britt-Marie ─æ├ú ß╗ƒ ─æ├óy"</a>┬á,┬á<a href="https://tiki.vn/ba-ngoai-toi-gui-loi-xin-loi-p1647103.html?spid=1647211">B├á Ngoß║íi T├┤i Gß╗¡i Lß╗¥i Xin Lß╗ùi,</a>┬á<a href="https://tiki.vn/beartown-thi-tran-nho-giac-mo-lon-p249876840.html?spid=249876841">Beartown - Thß╗ï trß║Ñn nhß╗Å, giß║Ñc m╞í lß╗¢n</a>,...lu├┤n xo├íy s├óu v├áo nß╗Öi t├óm con ng╞░ß╗¥i qua nhß╗»ng t├¼nh huß╗æng vß╗½a kß╗│ lß║í vß╗½a gß║ºn g┼⌐i. ├öng kh├┤ng chß╗ë viß║┐t tiß