ation-100 ease-in-out"><strong data-start="0" data-end="44" data-is-only-node="">Chuß╗ùi cung ß╗⌐ng to├án cß║ºu v├á vai tr├▓ TSMC:</strong> ─É├ái Loan sß║ún xuß║Ñt ~37ΓÇ»% c├┤ng suß║Ñt chip to├án cß║ºu; ASML giß╗» ─æß╗Öc quyß╗ün m├íy khß║»c chip EUV.</span></li>\n<li data-start="820" data-end="904">\n<p data-start="822" data-end="904"><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out"><strong data-start="0" data-end="54" data-is-only-node="">Sß╗▒ trß╗ùi dß║¡y cß╗ºa Trung Quß╗æc v├á c─âng thß║│ng Mß╗╣ΓÇôTrung:</strong> ─æß║ºu t╞░ lß╗¢n, hß║ín chß║┐ xuß║Ñt khß║⌐u c├┤ng nghß╗ç, nguy c╞í khß╗ƒi ─æß╗Öng h├ánh ─æß╗Öng ─æß╗ïa ch├¡nh trß╗ï</span> .</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="905" data-end="987">\n<p data-start="907" data-end="987"><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out"><strong data-start="0" data-end="21" data-is-only-node="">Chß╗º ─æß╗ü trung t├óm:</strong> chip l├á v┼⌐ kh├¡ ΓÇ£chiß║┐n tranh vi mß║íchΓÇ¥, vß╗¢i c├┤ng thß╗⌐c kß╗╣ thuß║¡t, kinh tß║┐, ch├¡nh trß╗ï ΓÇô v├á t╞░╞íng lai phß╗Ñ thuß╗Öc v├áo chuß╗ùi cung ß╗⌐ng</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">S├ích mang ─æß║┐n ─æiß╗üu g├¼ cho ng╞░ß╗¥i ─æß╗ìc?</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Hiß╗âu bß║ún chß║Ñt chip trong tr├▓ ch╞íi quyß╗ün lß╗▒c to├án cß║ºu, nh╞░ ΓÇ£─æß║ín ─æß║ío kß╗╣ thuß║¡t sß╗æΓÇ¥ trong cuß╗Öc chiß║┐n Mß╗╣ΓÇôTrung.</span></li>\n<li><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Bß║ún ─æß╗ô chuß╗ùi gi├í trß╗ï chip: tß╗½ nghi├¬n cß╗⌐u, sß║ún xuß║Ñt tß║íi Mß╗╣ v├á Nhß║¡t ─æß║┐n khß║»c chip ß╗ƒ H├á Lan, r├íp ─æ├│ng g├│i tß║íi ─É├ái Loan, H├án Quß╗æc.</span></li>\n<li><span class="relative -mx-px m