"1623">Start With Why</em>. Vß╗¢i nß╗ün tß║úng l├á nh├á t╞░ vß║Ñn chiß║┐n l╞░ß╗úc v├á truyß╗ün th├┤ng, Sinek ─æ├ú gi├║p h├áng tr─âm tß╗ò chß╗⌐c to├án cß║ºu ─æß╗ïnh h├¼nh lß║íi sß╗⌐ mß╗çnh v├á c├ích truyß╗ün cß║úm hß╗⌐ng.</p>\n<h3 data-start="1923" data-end="1940">Nß╗Öi dung s├ích</h3>\n<p data-start="1942" data-end="2253"><strong><em data-start="1942" data-end="1971">Bß║»t ─Éß║ºu Vß╗¢i C├óu Hß╗Åi Tß║íi Sao</em> </strong>x├óy dß╗▒ng to├án bß╗Ö lß║¡p luß║¡n xoay quanh m├┤ h├¼nh <strong data-start="2017" data-end="2051">V├▓ng tr├▓n v├áng (Golden Circle)</strong> ΓÇô gß╗ôm ba lß╗¢p: <strong data-start="2066" data-end="2100">Tß║íi sao ΓÇô L├ám thß║┐ n├áo ΓÇô C├íi g├¼</strong>. Theo Simon Sinek, c├íc tß╗ò chß╗⌐c v─⌐ ─æß║íi lu├┤n bß║»t ─æß║ºu bß║▒ng l├╜ do hß╗ì tß╗ôn tß║íi (Why), sau ─æ├│ mß╗¢i l├á ph╞░╞íng thß╗⌐c thß╗▒c hiß╗çn (How) v├á kß║┐t quß║ú hß╗ì cung cß║Ñp (What).</p>\n<ul data-start="2255" data-end="3133">\n<li data-start="2255" data-end="2404">\n<p data-start="2257" data-end="2404"><strong data-start="2257" data-end="2275">V├▓ng tr├▓n v├áng</strong>: M├┤ h├¼nh cß╗æt l├╡i gi├║p l├únh ─æß║ío v├á tß╗ò chß╗⌐c x├íc ─æß╗ïnh l├╜ do tß╗ôn tß║íi, tß╗½ ─æ├│ truyß╗ün cß║úm hß╗⌐ng mß║ính mß║╜ h╞ín cho nh├ón vi├¬n v├á kh├ích h├áng.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2406" data-end="2588">\n<p data-start="2408" data-end="2588"><strong data-start="2408" data-end="2433">Sß╗⌐c mß║ính cß╗ºa niß╗üm tin</strong>: Ph├ón t├¡ch c├ích c├íc c├┤ng ty nh╞░ Apple, Southwest Airlines hay Martin Luther King Jr. tß║ío n├¬n ß║únh h╞░ß╗ƒng bß║▒ng niß╗üm tin, kh├┤ng chß╗ë bß║▒ng t├¡nh n─âng hay gi├í cß║ú.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2590" data-end="2784">\n<p data-start="2592" data-end="2784"><strong data-start="2592" data-end="2642">Kh├íc biß╗çt giß╗»a ng╞░ß╗¥i dß║½n ─æß║ºu v├á ng╞░ß╗¥i theo sau</strong>: Nhß╗»ng l├únh ─æß║ío v─⌐ ─æß║íi ─æß╗üu ΓÇ£bß║»t ─æß║ºu vß╗¢i tß║íi saoΓÇ¥ ΓÇô tß║ío ─æß╗Öng lß╗▒c tß╗½ b├¬n trong, trong khi phß║ºn lß╗¢n c├▓n lß║íi chß╗ë tß║¡p trung v├áo kß║┐t quß║ú b├¬n ngo├ái.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2786" data-end="2960">\n<p data-start="2788" data-end="2960"><strong data-start="2788" data-end="2828">L├▓ng trung th├ánh &amp; ß║únh h╞░ß╗ƒng l├óu d├ái</strong>: Giß║úi th├¡ch c├ích ΓÇ£tß║íi saoΓÇ¥ l├á ch├¼a kh├│a ─æß╗â x├óy dß╗▒ng l├▓ng trung th├ánh vß╗»ng bß╗ün, thay v├¼ dß╗▒a v├áo khuyß║┐n m├úi hay chiß║┐n thuß║¡t ngß║»n hß║ín.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="2962" data-end="3133">\n<p data-start="2964" data-end="3133"><strong data-start="2964" data-end="2986">ß╗¿ng dß╗Ñng thß╗▒c tiß╗àn</strong>: S├ích cung cß║Ñp c├┤ng cß╗Ñ gi├║p tß╗ò chß╗⌐c kh├ím ph├í ΓÇ£tß║íi saoΓÇ¥ cß╗ºa m├¼nh v├á truyß╗ün tß║úi th├┤ng ─æiß╗çp n├áy ─æß║┐n mß╗ìi ─æiß╗âm chß║ím ΓÇô tß╗½ tiß║┐p thß╗ï ─æß║┐n quß║ún trß╗ï nh├ón sß╗▒.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="3140" data-end="3180">S├ích mang ─æß║┐n ─æiß╗üu g├¼ cho ng╞░ß╗¥i ─æß╗ìc?</h3>\n<ul data-start="3182" data-end="3522">\n<li data-start="3182" data-end="3253">\n<p data-start="3184" data-end="3253">Mß╗Öt m├┤ h├¼nh r├╡ r├áng gi├║p x├óy dß╗▒ng sß╗⌐ mß╗çnh th╞░╞íng hiß╗çu ─æß║ºy cß║úm hß╗⌐ng.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="3254" data-end="3331">\n<p data-start="3256" data-end="3331">Khß║ú n─âng ph├ón biß╗çt giß╗»a l├únh ─æß║ío truyß╗ün cß║úm hß╗⌐ng v├á quß║ún l├╜ th├┤ng th╞░ß╗¥ng.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="3332" data-end="3385">\n<p data-start="3334" data-end="3385">T╞░ duy dß║½n dß║»t bß║▒ng niß╗üm tin thay v├¼ chiß║┐n thuß║¡t.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="3386" data-end="3449">\n<p data-start="3388" data-end="3449">C├ích tß║ío ß║únh h╞░ß╗ƒng s├óu rß╗Öng v├á l├óu d├ái th├┤ng qua ΓÇ£tß║íi saoΓÇ¥.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="3450" data-end="3522">\n<p data-start="3452" data-end="3522">C├┤ng cß╗Ñ thß╗▒c tß║┐ ─æß╗â kh├ím ph├í v├á triß╗ân khai l├╜ do tß╗ôn tß║íi trong tß╗ò chß╗⌐c.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="209" data-end="242">Nhß║¡n x├⌐t cß╗ºa c├íc chuy├¬n gia, t├íc giß║ú s├ích, bi├¬n tß║¡p vi├¬n, tß╗¥ b├ío...(Nguß╗ôn: Editorial Reviews ΓÇô Amazon)</h3>\n<blockquote data-start="320" data-end="564">\n<p data-start=