i viß║┐t luß║¡n trong kß╗│ thi chß╗⌐ng chß╗ë tiß║┐ng Anh B1, B2, C1 theo ─æß╗ïnh dß║íng Vstep ─æ╞░ß╗úc tß╗ò chß╗⌐c tß║íi c├íc tr╞░ß╗¥ng ─æ╞░ß╗úc Bß╗Ö Gi├ío dß╗Ñc v├á ─É├áo tß║ío.</li>\n<li><strong>Ph├ón t├¡ch ─æß╗ü b├ái:</strong> gi├║p bß║ín nß║»m ─æ╞░ß╗úc dß║íng b├ái viß║┐t luß║¡n ─æß╗â biß║┐t c├ích triß╗ân khai b├ái viß║┐t.</li>\n<li><strong>D├án ├╜ chi tiß║┐t cho tr├¼nh ─æß╗Ö B1, B2:</strong> l├á khung x╞░╞íng cß╗ºa b├ái viß║┐t gi├║p bß║ín c├│ th├¬m mß╗Öt sß╗æ ├╜ ch├¡nh, c├íc ├╜ triß╗ân khai b├ái viß║┐t (v├¡ dß╗Ñ, l├¡ do, kß║┐t quß║úΓÇª)</li>\n<li><strong>B├ái viß║┐t mß║½u tr├¼nh ─æß╗Ö B1, B2:</strong> gi├║p bß║ín h├¼nh dung c├ích triß╗ân khai b├ái viß║┐t ho├án chß╗ënh tß╗½ d├án ├╜ chi tiß║┐t ─æ╞░ß╗úc gß╗úi ├╜.</li>\n<li><strong>Tß╗½ vß╗▒ng tr├¼nh ─æß╗Ö tiß║┐ng Anh B2:</strong> liß╗çt k├¬ nhß╗»ng tß╗½ vß╗▒ng, cß╗Ñm tß╗½ vß╗▒ng ─æß║ít cß║Ñp ─æß╗Ö B2, C1 gi├║p bß║ín bß╗ò trß╗ú tß╗½ vß╗▒ng hiß║┐m gß║╖p ─æß╗â dß╗à d├áng ─æß║ít ─æ╞░ß╗úc mß╗Ñc ti├¬u B2 vß╗¢i kß╗╣ n─âng N├│i v├á Viß║┐t.</li>\n</ul><p><img src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/0d/ef/f9/080f98eeb9a6c2d4cc7e13964db26b89.jpg" alt="S├ích Vstep writing B1, B2_─Éß╗ü thi viß║┐t luß║¡n" width="750" height="1070" /></p>\n<p style="text-align:center;"><strong><em>─Éß╗ü thi viß║┐t luß║¡n Vstep writing B1, B2</em></strong></p>\n<p style="text-align:center;"><strong><em><img src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c7/9c/46/ace97ab0b305fed6035cf6c2bb1c0f7d.jpg" alt="S├ích Vstep writing B1, B2 _Vstep writing essay samples" width="750" height="1070" /></em></strong></p>\n<p style="text-align:center;"><strong><em>D├án ├╜ chi tiß║┐t cho b├ái thi Vstep writing essay tr├¼nh ─æß╗Ö B1, B2</em></strong></p>\n<p style="text-align:center;"><strong><em><img src="https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/57/64/c9/56c37fbf83159942ecd3cc9059782a07.jpg" alt="S├ích Vstep Writing Essays _B├ái viß║┐t mß║½u" width="750" height="1070" /></em></strong></p>\n<p style="text-align:center;"><strong><em>Vstep writing essay samples</em></strong></p>\n<p style