 m├á kh├┤ng lß║»ng nghe, tß╗▒ chß╗ë tr├¡ch hoß║╖c chß╗ë tr├¡ch ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├íc, gß╗ìi ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├íc bß║▒ng nhß╗»ng c├íi t├¬n x├║c phß║ím, phß║ún ß╗⌐ng trong c╞ín giß║¡n, d├╣ng ng├┤n tß╗½ ch├¡nh trß╗ï, ph├▓ng thß╗º hoß║╖c ph├ín x├⌐t ai l├á ΓÇ£tß╗æt/xß║ÑuΓÇ¥ hay ─æiß╗üu g├¼ l├á ΓÇ£─æ├║ng/saiΓÇ¥ ΓÇö ─æß╗üu c├│ thß╗â ─æ╞░ß╗úc gß╗ìi l├á ΓÇ£giao tiß║┐p bß║ío lß╗▒cΓÇ¥.</p>\n<h3 data-start="600" data-end="632">Giao tiß║┐p phi bß║ío lß╗▒c l├á g├¼?</h3>\n<p data-start="634" data-end="685">Giao tiß║┐p Phi Bß║ío Lß╗▒c l├á sß╗▒ kß║┐t hß╗úp cß╗ºa bß╗æn yß║┐u tß╗æ:</p>\n<ul data-start="687" data-end="1193">\n<li data-start="687" data-end="809">\n<p data-start="689" data-end="809"><strong data-start="689" data-end="702">Nhß║¡n thß╗⌐c</strong>: mß╗Öt hß╗ç thß╗æng c├íc nguy├¬n tß║»c gi├║p ta sß╗æng mß╗Öt cuß╗Öc ─æß╗¥i ─æß║ºy l├▓ng trß║»c ß║⌐n, hß╗úp t├íc, d┼⌐ng cß║úm v├á ch├ón thß║¡t.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="810" data-end="899">\n<p data-start="812" data-end="899"><strong data-start="812" data-end="824">Ng├┤n ngß╗»</strong>: hiß╗âu ─æ╞░ß╗úc c├ích tß╗½ ngß╗» c├│ thß╗â tß║ío ra sß╗▒ kß║┐t nß╗æi hoß║╖c tß║ío ra khoß║úng c├ích.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="900" data-end="1087">\n<p data-start="902" data-end="1087"><strong data-start="902" data-end="915">Giao tiß║┐p</strong>: biß║┐t c├ích y├¬u cß║ºu ─æiß╗üu m├¼nh mong muß╗æn, biß║┐t c├ích lß║»ng nghe ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├íc ngay cß║ú khi bß║Ñt ─æß╗ông, v├á biß║┐t c├ích h╞░ß╗¢ng ─æß║┐n nhß╗»ng giß║úi ph├íp ─æem lß║íi lß╗úi ├¡ch cho tß║Ñt cß║ú mß╗ìi ng╞░ß╗¥i.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="1088" data-end="1193">\n<p data-start="1090" data-end="1193"><strong data-start="1090" data-end="1115">Ph╞░╞íng ph├íp ß║únh h╞░ß╗ƒng</strong>: chia sß║╗ ΓÇ£quyß╗ün lß╗▒c c├╣ng ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├ícΓÇ¥ thay v├¼ d├╣ng ΓÇ£quyß╗ün lß╗▒c l├¬n ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├ícΓÇ¥.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bß╗æi cß║únh cuß╗Öc sß╗æng ng├áy nay c├│ ─æß║ºy nhß╗»ng sß╗▒ xung ─æß╗Öt, m├óu thuß║½n giß╗»a c├íc c├í nh├ón, giß╗»a c├íc nh├│m v├á giß╗»a c├íc quß╗æc gia. Mß╗Öt trong nhß╗»ng l├╜ do ch├¡nh cß╗ºa viß╗çc n├áy nß║▒m ß╗ƒ nhß╗»ng lß╗¥i n├│i m├á ch├║ng ta sß╗¡ dß╗Ñng mß╗ùi ng├áy. Tiß║┐n s─⌐ Marshall Rosenberg, t├íc giß║ú cß╗ºa cuß╗æn s├ích, viß║┐t nh╞░ sau: ΓÇ£Bß║ín c├│ thß╗â ngh─⌐ rß║▒ng chß╗ë h├ánh vi thß╗â x├íc mß╗¢i dß║½n ─æß║┐n ΓÇ£bß║ío lß╗▒cΓÇ¥, nh╞░ng ch├¡nh ng├┤n tß╗½ ch├║ng ta sß╗¡ dß╗Ñng h├áng ng├áy mß╗¢i l├á thß╗⌐ g├óy ra nhiß╗üu ─æau khß╗ò v├á tß╗òn th╞░╞íng nhß║Ñt, cß║ú cho ng╞░ß╗¥i kh├íc v├á cho ch├¡nh m├¼nh.ΓÇ¥ Tß╗½ sß╗▒ quan s├ít n├áy, ├┤ng ─æ├ú ph├ít triß╗ân m├┤ h├¼nh Giao tiß║┐p bß║Ñt bß║ío ─æß╗Öng (Nonviolent Communication), gi├║p ch├║ng ta ├╜ thß╗⌐c v├á chuyß╗ân h├│a c├ích suy ngh─⌐ v├á giao tiß║┐p cß╗ºa m├¼nh.</p>\n<p data-start="631" data-end="650"><strong data-start="631" data-end="648">Nß╗Öi dung s├ích</strong></p>\n<ul data-start="651" data-end="858">\n<li data-start="651" data-end="692">\n<p data-start="653" data-end="692"><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Giß╗¢i thiß╗çu ph╞░╞íng ph├íp NVC qua bß╗æn b╞░ß╗¢c r├╡ r├áng: quan s├ít, cß║úm x├║c, nhu cß║ºu, y├¬u cß║ºu.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="693" data-end="734">\n<p data-start="695" data-end="734"><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">H╞░ß╗¢ng dß║½n thß╗▒c h├ánh cß╗Ñ thß╗â vß╗¢i v├¡ dß╗Ñ t├¼nh huß╗æng ─æa dß║íng nh╞░ xung ─æß╗Öt gia ─æ├¼nh, c├┤ng sß╗ƒ, tr╞░ß╗¥ng hß╗ìc.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="735" data-end="776">\n<p data-start="737" data-end="776"><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Nhß║Ñn mß║ính tß║ºm quan trß╗ìng cß╗ºa viß╗çc lß║»ng nghe v├á tß╗▒ thß╗â hiß╗çn mß╗Öt c├ích ch├ón th├ánh, tr├ính ph├ín x├⌐t.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start="777" data-end="818">\n<p data-start="779" data-end="818"><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Cung cß║Ñp c├íc kß╗╣ thuß║¡t tß╗▒ em v├á 